      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T19:04:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we add padding so that data is 4-byte aligned?\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n\tuint8_t cmd;\n\tuint8_t reserved[3];\n\tuint8_t data[FLEXIBLE_ARRAY_MEMBER_SIZE];\n```",
