      "writtenOn": "2026-02-10T14:07:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I understood Tom correctly, the potential problem is that we are fully trusting compiler here that the offset of data member within `ec_params_fp_template_v1` is always the same (on host and on the EC side). I think I like the Tom\u0027s suggestion to add the reserved data as padding to make sure `data` member is at certain offset.",
